41
00:02:29,472 --> 00:02:31,033
Beautiful one day

42
00:02:31,073 --> 00:02:32,355
Beauty， beauty

43
00:02:32,395 --> 00:02:33,595
one day

44
00:02:33,876 --> 00:02:34,637
