49
00:03:19,962 --> 00:03:21,724
Beautiful
Wednesday

50
00:03:21,764 --> 00:03:25,207
Beautiful Thursday

51
00:03:25,247 --> 00:03:28,211
Beautiful Friday

52
00:03:28,251 --> 00:03:31,294
Beautiful Saturday

53
00:03:31,334 --> 00:03:34,096
Beautiful Sunday

54
00:03:56,254 --> 00:03:57,981
將軍暗殺片一

55
00:03:58,509 --> 00:04:00,075
